WHAT IS DERIVED

The vehicle property reference — published on the site under
/learn/vehicle-properties/ and generated into data/vehicle-properties.ts — is
built from these AOSP source files:

    platform/hardware/interfaces
        automotive/vehicle/aidl_property/android/hardware/automotive/vehicle/
            VehicleProperty.aidl
            (and the enum definitions in the same directory)

    platform/packages/services/Car
        car-lib/src/android/car/VehiclePropertyIds.java
        car-lib/src/android/car/Car.java

The property descriptions are reproduced substantially verbatim from the
Javadoc comments in those files. Property identifiers, area types, access
modes, change modes, permission names and enum members are extracted from the
same sources.

STATEMENT OF CHANGES (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))

The material has been modified in the following ways:

  * Extracted from Java and AIDL source into structured data by
    scripts/generate-vehicle-properties.mjs.
  * Reformatted for display on the web, including the resolution of 32-bit
    property identifiers into their decimal and hexadecimal forms.
  * Annotated with relationships between properties (for example, that HVAC
    features are gated on HVAC_POWER_ON) that are not present as structured
    data in the original sources.
  * Accompanied by explanatory prose, diagrams, code samples and simulations
    that are original to this project and are not part of the AOSP material.

